WEBVTT

00:49:31.118 --> 00:49:33.424
Willingness is everything,

00:49:33.448 --> 00:49:36.871
and it applies to everything.

00:49:37.473 --> 00:49:38.665
Creativity, too.

00:49:38.689 --> 00:49:41.363
I'm willing to do this.
I'm willing to try this.

00:49:41.387 --> 00:49:45.866
I'm willing to fail.
I'm willing to be unsuccessful.

00:49:46.731 --> 00:49:50.407
Are you willing to take the hits
and then remain in the story?

00:49:50.915 --> 00:49:54.374
Or are you going to leave the story?

00:49:54.398 --> 00:49:55.923
I don't want to miss this story.

00:49:55.947 --> 00:49:58.543
I don't want to come all this way

00:49:58.567 --> 00:49:59.905
to do this life

00:49:59.929 --> 00:50:03.966
and then decide that it's too hard
and not show up for it.